    "title": "Seven Arkansas Baseball Games Scheduled for National TV - 2026 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By BVM Sportsdesk, ,\n1 days ago Seven Arkansas baseball games are set to be nationally televised during the 2026 season, featuring six contests on SEC Network and one on ESPNU. Four of these games will be played at Baum-Walker Stadium, showcasing the Razorbacks' home field advantage. Notably, 54 of Arkansas’ 56 regular-season games will be available on TV or streaming services, promising extensive coverage for fans. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
